      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.89,
          "en": "So how do we show an error message here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.89,
          "end": 6.84,
          "en": "Of course, it's important to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.84,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "that this message will only be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 10.62,
          "en": "if we make it into this if statement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "which will only be the case if at least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 15.213,
          "en": "one of these conditions here is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "Now to show this error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "we can use another built-in function provided by Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "and this time it will be the showDialog function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 29.97,
          "en": "which will show some info or error dialogue on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.97,
          "end": 32.643,
          "en": "some popup on the screen you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 36.93,
          "en": "ShowDialog, just like showDatePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.93,
          "end": 40.71,
          "en": "or showModalBottomSheet before wants a context value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 43.53,
          "en": "which we set to this context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "that's available in this state class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "And it wants such a builder function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51.21,
          "en": "which should be a function that takes some context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 54.603,
          "en": "as an input and returns a widget as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.68,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "And that widget will simply be the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 60.453,
          "en": "of that pop-up dialogue that will be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "So here we get this context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 65.88,
          "en": "provided by Flutter automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.88,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "when it executes this builder method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 70.26,
          "en": "And the widget I wanna return here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.26,
          "end": 72.783,
          "en": "will be one of the built-in dialogue widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.62,
          "end": 75.93,
          "en": "Now there are a couple of built-in dialogue widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 78.39,
          "en": "and I'm interested in the alert dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.39,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "which is a dialogue styled and optimized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 83.883,
          "en": "for showing some alert message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.81,
          "end": 88.38,
          "en": "The alert dialogue widget then has a couple of parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.38,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "that can be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "For example, a title parameter, which wants another widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.99000000000001,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "where I'll use the text widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 98.07300000000001,
          "en": "to give this pop-up window a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "For example, invalid input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 103.773,
          "en": "And this can be converted to a constant text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "I'll not convert the overall AlertDialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 109.713,
          "en": "because this would soon not be possible anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "Because the title is not all that's added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "instead I also will add some content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "which is the main text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "the main content shown in the dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 122.04,
          "en": "And here, I'll create another text widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.04,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "though you could also use other widgets in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 125.85,
          "en": "don't get me wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.85,
          "end": 129.217,
          "en": "but here I'll use some simple text and for example, say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.217,
          "end": 134.217,
          "en": "\"Please make sure a valid title, amount, date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.18,
          "end": 138.6,
          "en": "and category was entered.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.6,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "And now last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "we can also set the actions parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 146.43,
          "en": "along with many other parameters, as you can see, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.43,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "But here it's the actions parameter, which I wanna set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "which allows you to define a bunch of actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "typically buttons that should be displayed in that dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "which for example, allow the user to close the dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "so to close this popup window.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 167.1,
          "en": "And here I'll add a simple text button as an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.1,
          "end": 170.61,
          "en": "where onPressed, of course, must be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.61,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "to an anonymous function here where I then actually want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 179.45,
          "en": "to close this dialogue by again using navigator.pop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 182.94,
          "en": "as we did it before for the modal bottom sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.94,
          "end": 185.37,
          "en": "and the pop method wants the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 188.43,
          "en": "In this case, the context connected to this dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.43,
          "end": 190.71,
          "en": "so this CTX value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.71,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "which is passed into this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 194.223,
          "en": "automatically by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 197.64,
          "en": "And besides setting onPressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.64,
          "end": 200.34,
          "en": "I of course also set my child here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.34,
          "end": 203.01,
          "en": "the main content of this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.01,
          "end": 205.65,
          "en": "And here I'll set this to a text widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 207.603,
          "en": "where I simply say okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.44,
          "end": 210.483,
          "en": "and turn this into a constant text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.79,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "And with that, we're showing this error dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 221.21,
          "en": "Now, as a last step, I just also want to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "after showing this dialogue because as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 227.82,
          "en": "whenever you return in a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.82,
          "end": 230.16,
          "en": "you make sure that no code thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 232.503,
          "en": "in that function gets executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.46,
          "end": 237.32999999999998,
          "en": "So here I'm returning after calling showDialog,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.32999999999998,
          "end": 239.43,
          "en": "but still inside of this if statement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.43,
          "end": 241.65,
          "en": "so that any code I add thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.65,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "won't be executed if we made it into this if statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 247.71,
          "en": "Because if we make it in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.71,
          "end": 251.37,
          "en": "I just wanna show this dialogue and then do nothing else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.37,
          "end": 255.3,
          "en": "I don't want to continue because soon when we continue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.3,
          "end": 258.63,
          "en": "we will use the entered data and create a new expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.63,
          "end": 260.22,
          "en": "And that, of course, should not happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.22,
          "end": 262.383,
          "en": "if invalid data has been entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 265.14,
          "en": "So with all that out of the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.14,
          "end": 269.49,
          "en": "if we save this and force a reload, if I open this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.49,
          "end": 273.03,
          "en": "and I enter nothing, I get this error dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.03,
          "end": 275.43,
          "en": "which I can close of course, but I get it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.43,
          "end": 278.49,
          "en": "whenever I try to submit invalid data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 278.49,
          "end": 281.4,
          "en": "And that therefore, of course, works exactly as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.4,
          "end": 284.01,
          "en": "Now, as a next step, we can make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.01,
          "end": 286.53,
          "en": "that if valid data was entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.53,
          "end": 289.74,
          "en": "we use that data to update this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.74,
          "end": 293.4,
          "en": "And this is actually something which you can try on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 293.4,
          "end": 295.35,
          "en": "because this is actually something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.35,
          "end": 299.19,
          "en": "which we basically already did in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.19,
          "end": 301.92,
          "en": "Of course not in this exact app, but the pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.92,
          "end": 306.21,
          "en": "the approach you need here is one we already used before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.21,
          "end": 307.71,
          "en": "but of course in the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.71,
          "end": 309.36,
          "en": "we'll also implement it together.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
